      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GENTLE SPARK (1) flew the lids with a fast early split and went on to clock 20.79 when a 1.5 lengths winner over 365m at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings six times from seven attempts. Well placed and will be tough to beat. WINSOME WANDA (3) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (21.06) at this track behind Delusional Bev in a Grade 5. Expected to be in this for a long way. FORTY'S GIRL (4) has a strong record this trip with eight wins and seven placings from 18 starts. Missed the frame latest (30.47) when fifth over 520m at this track in a Grade 5. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. MIDNIGHT GHOST (5) generally performs well over this distance.",
